        "pl-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "2ab29e19-2a06-31e2-8caa-33456a1c98bc",
                "word": "milieu",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "pl",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "aabdb112-caaa-310d-84a0-32e1bc349859",
                        "entry_id": "2ab29e19-2a06-31e2-8caa-33456a1c98bc",
                        "glosses": [
                            "otoczenie, środowisko"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7b5084f6-b8e4-453c-99e4-cb716f52a717",
                                "sense_id": "aabdb112-caaa-310d-84a0-32e1bc349859",
                                "text": "… trzeba było przebrać się „wyjściowo” i przez tę chwilę człowiek przypominał sobie milieu, z jakiego pochodził"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2a27133c-1079-4949-9f8d-643fbb404116",
                        "source_entry_id": "2ab29e19-2a06-31e2-8caa-33456a1c98bc",
                        "source_sense_id": "aabdb112-caaa-310d-84a0-32e1bc349859",
                        "target_lang_word": "milieu",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "milieu",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "34385823-f26b-31cf-bf8e-7abc51c98329",
                                        "entry_id": "2907a5ef-783a-39b6-9923-199bc5f17667",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An environment or setting; a medium; environs"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "77220348-95c5-412d-a542-7718d3751016",
                                                "sense_id": "34385823-f26b-31cf-bf8e-7abc51c98329",
                                                "text": "Australian cinema is a messy affair. It is a messiness not only in our ways of knowing, reading, consuming and producing films and the larger film-making milieu of which they are a part, but also a messiness among the films themselves […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e642f696-c1ac-41c7-ac06-debcd4545268",
                                                "sense_id": "34385823-f26b-31cf-bf8e-7abc51c98329",
                                                "text": "In the electronic milieu, accuracy is accomplished by the technology, and the appropriate strategy for judgment is likely to entail ensuring coherence within and across electronic and naturalistic components of the ecology."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7dbee7e5-bbea-4612-b077-f72ee4d58b58",
                                                "sense_id": "34385823-f26b-31cf-bf8e-7abc51c98329",
                                                "text": "The library as solely a physical space will not survive in the digital milieu. Services should be directed towards user needs and desires in the current academic climate."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d96f03cf-d7a0-48aa-be08-698c83fe2e0b",
                                                "sense_id": "34385823-f26b-31cf-bf8e-7abc51c98329",
                                                "text": "The question is, then, what is the relationship of biblical narrative to its literary milieu? […] One must simultaneously biblical narrative in light of its clear historical connections to its literary milieu, while carefully analyzing the profound differences separating it from its milieu as well."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2ca367d9-81cf-3c28-9a2f-16861209cd53",
                                        "entry_id": "2907a5ef-783a-39b6-9923-199bc5f17667",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A social environment or setting."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "specifically"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7e8a58f9-4e0d-48be-b1eb-d4da6aa66872",
                                                "sense_id": "2ca367d9-81cf-3c28-9a2f-16861209cd53",
                                                "text": "The distinction between the constituents in, and the conditions of, the integral life-career of person is well brought out in contrasting the attitudes of attention which persons normally develop with the milieux or social media which serve as the theater for their exercise. […] The assertive attitude of challenge finds its milieux in the domains of sport, art, exercise, industry, etc., to which the conception of gestalt may well be extended."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ba71ff31-a6ed-4361-ade4-725e745e5d81",
                                                "sense_id": "2ca367d9-81cf-3c28-9a2f-16861209cd53",
                                                "text": "Confronted by the multiplicity of the milieus that could influence curriculum activity, we need some way of deciding not only what kinds of milieus should claim our attention, but also what kinds of knowledge about them we should attend to."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f37d6e52-3157-46b1-8a7f-1b162b21393a",
                                                "sense_id": "2ca367d9-81cf-3c28-9a2f-16861209cd53",
                                                "text": "The unmistakable directness and violence of Jesus' action shows it to have been undertaken and executed precisely as if the milieu were indeed not there to be counted. Here again is the character of action taken in the very face of the milieu without taking any notice of it. In any event, the one certainty is that the Roman milieu, so entirely ignored by his teaching, here came conclusively to touch upon it, putting Jesus to an end."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "48a70f55-6dd8-48aa-9185-c7d1d3cb7d68",
                                                "sense_id": "2ca367d9-81cf-3c28-9a2f-16861209cd53",
                                                "text": "Certain milieus are described as cosmopolitan. Typically these are artistic, intellectual and bohemian milieus, but also the world of international business and high finance, and some mafias and underworlds."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "020a5356-4306-4ad8-9a02-0ce194a6ccc6",
                                                "sense_id": "2ca367d9-81cf-3c28-9a2f-16861209cd53",
                                                "text": "The vast majority of our intensive child and adolescent treatment milieus operate within an adult-centric model, wherein staff play the central role in developing, instilling and enforcing the culture; a model that places virtually all power and authority in the hands of the supervising adults."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b6dd180d-c38a-46d9-b3a7-4b3e9ef05c39",
                                                "sense_id": "2ca367d9-81cf-3c28-9a2f-16861209cd53",
                                                "text": "[F]rom the perspective of traditional linguistic landscapes thought, such an overwhelmingly English landscape would normally be considered to exert a negative effect on the vitality and feelings of worth of other languages within this specific multilingual milieu."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a49aeab7-53bb-3ea0-ab0c-c816f43eeac6",
                                        "entry_id": "2907a5ef-783a-39b6-9923-199bc5f17667",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A group of people with a common point of view; a social class or group."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5513b642-c9f6-479d-8bd3-968e1c9186a0",
                                                "sense_id": "a49aeab7-53bb-3ea0-ab0c-c816f43eeac6",
                                                "text": "It's not easy to find someone whom one has mislaid for years in London, particularly if she belongs to the sort of milieu that Anna belonged to, but clearly the first thing to do is look in the telephone book."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1f484eb9-72fc-49c7-a500-43ab4d0c26b7",
                        "source_entry_id": "2ab29e19-2a06-31e2-8caa-33456a1c98bc",
                        "source_sense_id": "aabdb112-caaa-310d-84a0-32e1bc349859",
                        "target_lang_word": "environment",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "environment",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "54be233a-fa8e-3cce-904e-8f9ca746d3c9",
                                        "entry_id": "f87dc9f5-d5b8-3632-aff2-08b5a9ca6475",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The surroundings of, and influences on, a particular item of interest."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b2d01228-4ad3-4689-83c5-9a41e3fb6a3b",
                                                "sense_id": "54be233a-fa8e-3cce-904e-8f9ca746d3c9",
                                                "text": "What was seen from the top down, as a large environment with many difficult trade-offs, is instead seen from the bottom up--as 10 million microenvironments, each to be regulated in its own right. It is this inversion of perspective that distinguishes microgovernment from other kinds of regulation, and that accounts for its often-bizarre behavior."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0a664b54-bcbb-3f22-a819-f65dd1b04fff",
                                        "entry_id": "f87dc9f5-d5b8-3632-aff2-08b5a9ca6475",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The natural world or ecosystem."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "acbc2b74-ec95-4d48-bb35-15476e08dc33",
                                                "sense_id": "0a664b54-bcbb-3f22-a819-f65dd1b04fff",
                                                "text": "It is tempting to speculate about the incentives or compulsions that might explain why anyone would take to the skies in [the] basket [of a balloon]: […]; […]; or perhaps to muse on the irrelevance of the borders that separate nation states and keep people from understanding their shared environment."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ed0b3c24-fcb2-3017-a898-2e53fbd9cdfa",
                                        "entry_id": "f87dc9f5-d5b8-3632-aff2-08b5a9ca6475",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "All the elements that affect a system or its inputs and outputs."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9bbd9242-43d1-36a4-8d04-4d4a557f73f2",
                                        "entry_id": "f87dc9f5-d5b8-3632-aff2-08b5a9ca6475",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A particular political or social setting, arena or condition."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "be84d9a3-6ec7-3cd9-81f3-2d5574ef6785",
                                        "entry_id": "f87dc9f5-d5b8-3632-aff2-08b5a9ca6475",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The software or hardware existing on any particular computer system."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a151a32a-f1ec-4d84-97de-7353e3c3051b",
                                                "sense_id": "be84d9a3-6ec7-3cd9-81f3-2d5574ef6785",
                                                "text": "That program uses the Microsoft Windows environment."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a5cb2fa6-9acf-34b0-9a9a-70b214c2e45b",
                                        "entry_id": "f87dc9f5-d5b8-3632-aff2-08b5a9ca6475",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The environment of a function at a point during the execution of a program is the set of identifiers in the function's scope and their bindings at that point."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3ec92c32-9697-3951-b69d-243b33a48e2c",
                                        "entry_id": "f87dc9f5-d5b8-3632-aff2-08b5a9ca6475",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The set of variables and their values in a namespace that an operating system associates with a process."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d6173e03-94b3-4534-a614-38d3cd38b239",
                        "source_entry_id": "2ab29e19-2a06-31e2-8caa-33456a1c98bc",
                        "source_sense_id": "aabdb112-caaa-310d-84a0-32e1bc349859",
                        "target_lang_word": "milieu",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "milieu",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b60ab7b2-27dc-38a6-89c7-c3b4812f42b4",
                                        "entry_id": "1549398b-dc1b-3cf2-afef-541e067ea641",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Endroit qui, dans un lieu ou un objet, est également distant de la périphérie ou des extrémités."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "24bbd23e-eaa1-4f5c-a9f7-8bac69740518",
                                                "sense_id": "b60ab7b2-27dc-38a6-89c7-c3b4812f42b4",
                                                "text": "On a mis le monument au milieu de la place."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "854da68b-ecff-49a6-bc80-990d10365694",
                                                "sense_id": "b60ab7b2-27dc-38a6-89c7-c3b4812f42b4",
                                                "text": "Couper un fruit par le milieu."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "367e7aef-8d94-382d-8b01-6bcc42b7356a",
                                        "entry_id": "1549398b-dc1b-3cf2-afef-541e067ea641",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Point situé à égale distance des extrémités du segment."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "221498cb-cad4-35ad-b6c6-9e2cdbae8ce1",
                                        "entry_id": "1549398b-dc1b-3cf2-afef-541e067ea641",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Tout endroit qui est à une distance plus ou moins égale des extrémités, de la périphérie, sans que cela fût rigoureusement exact."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Plus courant"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "162d2dd8-7120-4bc9-ab93-c6fba9ba6587",
                                                "sense_id": "221498cb-cad4-35ad-b6c6-9e2cdbae8ce1",
                                                "text": "Au milieu du chemin, au milieu du bois."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "385e30a4-0f57-4b1f-8f92-e3a7c6a850f2",
                                                "sense_id": "221498cb-cad4-35ad-b6c6-9e2cdbae8ce1",
                                                "text": "La rivière passe au milieu de la ville."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1ed92bb8-5487-44d9-9f4f-e99e65e73fc1",
                                                "sense_id": "221498cb-cad4-35ad-b6c6-9e2cdbae8ce1",
                                                "text": "Il prit son adversaire par le milieu du corps."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "08c82dd3-a10e-3007-ba53-1d9b09c83da2",
                                        "entry_id": "1549398b-dc1b-3cf2-afef-541e067ea641",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Point qui est également éloigné des deux termes d’un espace de temps."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "168745df-3a26-40d4-8d7b-555d840f7a1d",
                                                "sense_id": "08c82dd3-a10e-3007-ba53-1d9b09c83da2",
                                                "text": "Vers le milieu de la nuit."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "781572ee-9f0b-4e1b-a221-abcb943b17d2",
                                                "sense_id": "08c82dd3-a10e-3007-ba53-1d9b09c83da2",
                                                "text": "Sur le milieu du jour."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "854d2174-5b3a-44b8-89b9-abb3f0cdfac2",
                                                "sense_id": "08c82dd3-a10e-3007-ba53-1d9b09c83da2",
                                                "text": "Être au milieu de l’été, de l’hiver."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cfe2e1c4-ad21-4472-aa63-1d6a3c411111",
                                                "sense_id": "08c82dd3-a10e-3007-ba53-1d9b09c83da2",
                                                "text": "Le soleil était au milieu de sa course, la nuit était au milieu de son cours."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "83ec7d00-ac3f-39ae-a16a-811574010de0",
                                        "entry_id": "1549398b-dc1b-3cf2-afef-541e067ea641",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Partie centrale des écrits ou des discours, par rapport à leur commencement et à leur fin."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "analogy"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fb312352-d4a5-4af3-a0d8-6714a2443029",
                                                "sense_id": "83ec7d00-ac3f-39ae-a16a-811574010de0",
                                                "text": "Il fut interrompu, il demeura court au milieu de sa harangue."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "74399a5d-f883-4bec-9867-bc194f498530",
                                                "sense_id": "83ec7d00-ac3f-39ae-a16a-811574010de0",
                                                "text": "Il se leva au milieu du sermon."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4f9ae046-3401-4e9d-af2c-4596f716b7be",
                                                "sense_id": "83ec7d00-ac3f-39ae-a16a-811574010de0",
                                                "text": "Ce passage se trouve vers le milieu du livre."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e772a2cb-608a-3fe1-86c8-577ee8e3d1a9",
                                        "entry_id": "1549398b-dc1b-3cf2-afef-541e067ea641",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ce qui est également éloigné de tout ce qui est extrême, exagéré, de ce qui dépasse la mesure."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "24ebbb1a-a644-4d85-b02a-590283022df0",
                                                "sense_id": "e772a2cb-608a-3fe1-86c8-577ee8e3d1a9",
                                                "text": "La sagesse se trouve dans un juste milieu."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b1ece126-4452-4981-8c72-c912e356da59",
                                                "sense_id": "e772a2cb-608a-3fe1-86c8-577ee8e3d1a9",
                                                "text": "La libéralité tient le milieu entre la prodigalité et l’avarice."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "27eb4afa-3874-461e-a1d2-91f1ae142a56",
                                                "sense_id": "e772a2cb-608a-3fe1-86c8-577ee8e3d1a9",
                                                "text": "Il faut savoir en tout garder le milieu, le juste milieu, un juste milieu."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "35c73a01-2672-4953-8f4f-a9224b057121",
                                                "sense_id": "e772a2cb-608a-3fe1-86c8-577ee8e3d1a9",
                                                "text": "Trouver, saisir, prendre le milieu entre les extrêmes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "25e55e2c-1bd4-4f2c-aabc-003bd821d584",
                                                "sense_id": "e772a2cb-608a-3fe1-86c8-577ee8e3d1a9",
                                                "text": "Esprit de juste milieu."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "980a1973-4105-4257-8e0b-f0774ab28f1c",
                                                "sense_id": "e772a2cb-608a-3fe1-86c8-577ee8e3d1a9",
                                                "text": "Opinion de juste milieu."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "161e4906-9a16-4bae-846c-abaf3fb8d1f0",
                                                "sense_id": "e772a2cb-608a-3fe1-86c8-577ee8e3d1a9",
                                                "text": "Il n’y a point de milieu."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b7fb8d47-3e9f-42b2-8870-f96b8b52f9ed",
                                                "sense_id": "e772a2cb-608a-3fe1-86c8-577ee8e3d1a9",
                                                "text": "Ne hasardez jamais votre estime trop tôt,\nEt soyez pour cela dans le milieu qu'il faut."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "46bf0ab1-166a-365d-9a46-c5752399c715",
                                        "entry_id": "1549398b-dc1b-3cf2-afef-541e067ea641",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Substance dans laquelle un corps est placé, ou qui est traversée par un corps ou une radiation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "physical"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "61833a77-7e0f-4146-b65f-76c85b190dac",
                                                "sense_id": "46bf0ab1-166a-365d-9a46-c5752399c715",
                                                "text": "Un gaz est un milieu produisant sur les projectiles une déviation d’autant plus grande qu’il est plus dense."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "554c01a8-6bb5-49d7-9dc0-983e426324ae",
                                                "sense_id": "46bf0ab1-166a-365d-9a46-c5752399c715",
                                                "text": "Un rayon lumineux est réfracté quand il passe d’un milieu dans un autre."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c1b323b2-da01-34f4-8179-d1b07f44c375",
                                        "entry_id": "1549398b-dc1b-3cf2-afef-541e067ea641",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ensemble des conditions où vivent les animaux et les végétaux."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "45cdbebc-a8f7-4026-ad6b-47b414f6eb4a",
                                                "sense_id": "c1b323b2-da01-34f4-8179-d1b07f44c375",
                                                "text": "Les traités de phytogéographie étudient en général l’action du milieu sur la répartition des plantes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0d458b99-e38e-4611-8502-bb31bdac0ecc",
                                                "sense_id": "c1b323b2-da01-34f4-8179-d1b07f44c375",
                                                "text": "Le terme «soudanien» désigne couramment un milieu climatique et végétal de l’Afrique intertropicale. Se rapportant plus habituellement au nord de l’Équateur, il comporte cependant un homologue dans l'hémisphère sud, dénommé «zambézien»."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6106037c-7e6e-32ef-b8d6-88c55a64dee6",
                                        "entry_id": "1549398b-dc1b-3cf2-afef-541e067ea641",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Élément propre à la vie d’un être."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "edfd9ae4-1d56-4abc-bddd-14a9ba4edab9",
                                                "sense_id": "6106037c-7e6e-32ef-b8d6-88c55a64dee6",
                                                "text": "Nous avons donc fait germer aseptiquement des spores de Funaires sur des milieux additionnés d’acide naphtyl-acétique à des concentrations de 10⁻⁹, 10⁻⁷, 10⁻⁵. Le même milieu, sans acide naphtyl-acétique, a été pris comme témoin."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "01bf40d8-5a42-43ad-8e91-79950e55f0f6",
                                                "sense_id": "6106037c-7e6e-32ef-b8d6-88c55a64dee6",
                                                "text": "L’actinobacille préfère donc de beaucoup les milieux légèrement alcalins et redoute les milieux acides."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bb94011e-8cd7-3939-85e7-7c9b5ac12164",
                                        "entry_id": "1549398b-dc1b-3cf2-afef-541e067ea641",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Société où nous vivons."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3a0b4c09-8dd0-4023-a781-3fc43189e46d",
                                                "sense_id": "bb94011e-8cd7-3939-85e7-7c9b5ac12164",
                                                "text": "Les troubles tout récents de Russie ont contribué à populariser l’idée de grève générale dans les milieux des professionnels de la politique."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "98935214-797b-48f3-ad1e-de60e148a34a",
                                                "sense_id": "bb94011e-8cd7-3939-85e7-7c9b5ac12164",
                                                "text": "Malgré certaine curiosité professionnelle et la flatteuse illusion que rien d’humain ne lui devait demeurer étranger, Julius était peu descendu jusqu’à présent hors des coutumes de sa classe et n’avait guère eu de rapports qu’avec des gens de son milieu."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2bad4210-f391-4bdb-a367-65a20f8d5384",
                                                "sense_id": "bb94011e-8cd7-3939-85e7-7c9b5ac12164",
                                                "text": "J’ai ouï-dire qu’en mars dernier il fut sérieusement question, dans les milieux maritimes, d’envoyer une brigade aux Dardanelles ; […]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b97ff8e6-e57e-47d0-97ea-741bca6e7046",
                                                "sense_id": "bb94011e-8cd7-3939-85e7-7c9b5ac12164",
                                                "text": "On ne fait plus d’enfants, chez nous, sauf dans les coins pouilleux, dans les milieux de misère, certains samedi de paye, après stations devant les comptoirs des bistrots."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "38230daa-f870-46cb-ba4f-aded65bfc5c3",
                                                "sense_id": "bb94011e-8cd7-3939-85e7-7c9b5ac12164",
                                                "text": "La ploutocratie chilienne s’était appuyée sur deux forces : les milieux réactionnaires de la Marine et les intérêts impérialistes britanniques."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9bbf8fa3-5406-4106-b6a9-13350775430b",
                                                "sense_id": "bb94011e-8cd7-3939-85e7-7c9b5ac12164",
                                                "text": "Fin février, on se rendait compte dans tous les milieux français et indigènes qu'il fallait faire une fois de plus son deuil des espérances que l'on avait caressées."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "926afeb7-5fa7-3782-865d-666f11ebf4f2",
                                        "entry_id": "1549398b-dc1b-3cf2-afef-541e067ea641",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Pègre, l’ensemble des délinquants et des criminels."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "especially"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e9cd6c07-7aff-48ca-93fc-a62fcbb72090",
                                                "sense_id": "926afeb7-5fa7-3782-865d-666f11ebf4f2",
                                                "text": "Il s’agissait d’un authentique drame du « milieu » ou, plutôt, […], d’une histoire de « peaux rouges », de « truands »."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
